<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><title>Akun Merchant</title></head>
<body style="font-family: Montserrat, Arial, sans-serif; color: #4b4b4b; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <h2 style="color:#17283c;">Hallo, {{name}}</h2>
  <p>Akun anda telah didaftarkan sebagai merchant. Silahkan masukkan nomor merchant dan password di bawah ini untuk login.</p>
  <p style="text-align:center;margin:24px 0 8px;">
    <span style="font-weight:700;font-size:24px;color:#17283c;">{{uniqueNumber}}</span>
  </p>
  <p style="text-align:center;margin:0 0 24px;">
    <span style="font-weight:700;font-size:24px;color:#17283c;">{{password}}</span>
  </p>
  <p style="margin-top:24px;">Salam Kami,<br>{{school}}</p>
  <p style="margin-top:20px;font-size:11px;color:#abb4be;border-top:1px solid #eee;padding-top:16px;text-align:center;">
    &copy; {{year}} {{school}}. All Rights Reserved.
  </p>
</body>
</html>
